  "notes": "<p>Mike teased I Want You Back in Free. Trey added the lyrics &quot;bright in the daytime&quot; to Cities in reference to the show&#39;s early start time of 6:30pm, and teased Take Me Out to the Ballgame during Ghost. Trey sang part of San-Ho-Zay in the Sneakin&#39; Sally vocal jam. Prior to Page&#39;s solo in Rocky Top, Trey said &quot;sometimes at the end of the game, you gotta bring in your relief pitcher.&quot; The baseball themes in this show were a nod to Page having thrown out the first pitch at the Mets/Angels game at Citi Field earlier in the day.</p>",
